ge that would be dealt to you and creatures you control this turn.","power":null,"produced_mana":[],"released_at":"2012-07-13","toughness":null,"type_line":"Instant"},{"cmc":0.0,"color_identity":["B"],"colors":[],"defense":null,"keywords":[],"layout":"normal","legalities":{"alchemy":"legal","brawl":"legal","commander":"legal","competitivebrawl":"legal","duel":"legal","future":"legal","gladiator":"legal","historic":"legal","legacy":"legal","modern":"legal","oathbreaker":"legal","oldschool":"not_legal","pauper":"legal","paupercommander":"legal","penny":"legal","pioneer":"legal","predh":"legal","premodern":"legal","standard":"legal","standardbrawl":"legal","timeless":"legal","tlr":"legal","vintage":"legal"},"loyalty":null,"mana_cost":"","name":"Swamp","oracle_id":"56719f6a-1a6c-4c0a-8d21-18f7d7350b68","oracle_text":"({T}: Add {B}.)","power":null,"produced_mana":["B"],"released_at":"2026-06-26","toughness":null,"type_line":"Basic Land — Swamp"},{"cmc":4.0,"color_identity":["B"],"colors":["B"],"defense":null,"keywords":[],"layout":"normal","legalities":{"alchemy":"not_legal","brawl":"legal","commander":"legal","competitivebrawl":"legal","duel":"legal","future":"not_legal","gladiator":"legal","historic":"legal","legacy":"legal","modern":"legal","oathbreaker":"legal","oldschool":"not_legal","pauper":"legal","paupercommander":"legal","penny":"not_legal","pioneer":"not_legal","predh":"legal","premodern":"not_legal","standard":"not_legal","standardbrawl":"not_legal","timeless":"legal","tlr":"not_legal","vintage":"legal"},"loyalty":null,"mana_cost":"{3}{B}","name":"Tendrils of Corruption","oracle_id":"84ee0da2-d886-4603-9aaa-bc5326a424d7","oracle_text":"Tendrils of Corruption deals X damage to target creature and you gain X life, where X is the number of Swamps you control.","power":null,"produced_mana":[],"released_at":"2021-03-19","toughness":null,"type_line":"Instant"}],"fixture_kind":"public_exact-list_card_data","rulings":[{"comment":"Players can only respond once this spell has been cast and all its costs have been paid. No one can try to interfere with the creature you sacrificed to prevent you from casting this spell.","oracle_id":"24227761-b50e-4b9e-93a2-e82d053b3e3d","published_at":"2019-10-04","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"You must sacrifice exactly one creature to cast this spell; you can't cast it without sacrificing a creature, and you can't sacrifice additional creatures.","oracle_id":"24227761-b50e-4b9e-93a2-e82d053b3e3d","published_at":"2019-10-04","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"Use the sacrificed creature's power as it last existed on the battlefield to determine how much damage Fling deals.","oracle_id":"24227761-b50e-4b9e-93a2-e82d053b3e3d","published_at":"2024-04-12","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"Players can only respond once this spell has been cast and all its costs have been paid. No one can try to destroy the creature you sacrificed to prevent you from casting this spell.","oracle_id":"327121a1-f193-44c6-a834-802095abec84","published_at":"2013-04-15","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"You must sacrifice exactly one creature to cast this spell; you cannot cast it without sacrificing a creature, and you cannot sacrifice additional creatures.","oracle_id":"327121a1-f193-44c6-a834-802095abec84","published_at":"2013-04-15","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"If the target creature is an illegal target by the time Tendrils of Corruption tries to resolve, the spell doesn't resolve. You don't gain X life.","oracle_id":"84ee0da2-d886-4603-9aaa-bc5326a424d7","published_at":"2021-03-19","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"The swamps are counted on resolution.","oracle_id":"a88a1c53-7de3-423a-a95a-24ed5666ab96","published_at":"2004-10-04","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"The amount of damage dealt to a creature is not bounded by its toughness, and the amount of damage dealt to a player is not bounded by that player's life total. For example, if Corrupt deals 6 damage to a 2/2 creature, you'll gain 6 life.","oracle_id":"a88a1c53-7de3-423a-a95a-24ed5666ab96","published_at":"2010-08-15","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"The life you gain is equal to the damage dealt by Corrupt, not necessarily to the number of Swamps you control (if some or all of the damage is prevented, for example).","oracle_id":"a88a1c53-7de3-423a-a95a-24ed5666ab96","published_at":"2010-08-15","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"Corrupt counts any land you control with the subtype Swamp, not just ones named Swamp.","oracle_id":"a88a1c53-7de3-423a-a95a-24ed5666ab96","published_at":"2013-07-01","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"Corrupt counts any land you control with the subtype Swamp, not just ones named Swamp.","oracle_id":"a88a1c53-7de3-423a-a95a-24ed5666ab96","published_at":"2022-10-14","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"This has basic land types, but it isn't a basic land. Things that affect basic lands don't affect it. Things that affect basic land types do.","oracle_id":"b76d1ae6-ad1d-4bac-b4c3-2e03e0e84d9b","published_at":"2008-10-01","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"This has the mana abilities associated with both of its basic land types.","oracle_id":"b76d1ae6-ad1d-4bac-b4c3-2e03e0e84d9b","published_at":"2008-10-01","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"Deflecting Palm doesn't target any permanent or player. You choose a source of damage as Deflecting Palm resolves.","oracle_id":"dc5dffc8-fac5-4956-bac4-1ad2cc16f6be","published_at":"2014-09-20","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"If multiple prevention and/or replacement effects are trying to apply to the same damage, the player who would be dealt damage chooses the order in which to apply them.","oracle_id":"dc5dffc8-fac5-4956-bac4-1ad2cc16f6be","published_at":"2014-09-20","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"Safe Passage doesn’t prevent damage that would be dealt to planeswalkers you control.","oracle_id":"dfa459a1-b065-4488-88d3-4da388261b52","published_at":"2009-10-01","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"Safe Passage has no effect on damage that’s already been dealt.","oracle_id":"dfa459a1-b065-4488-88d3-4da388261b52","published_at":"2009-10-01","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"Safe Passage prevents all damage, not just combat damage, that would be dealt to you and creatures you control this turn.","oracle_id":"dfa459a1-b065-4488-88d3-4da388261b52","published_at":"2009-10-01","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"Safe Passage will prevent damage dealt to creatures that weren’t on the battlefield at the time it resolved.","oracle_id":"dfa459a1-b065-4488-88d3-4da388261b52","published_at":"2009-10-01","source":"wotc"}],"schema_version":1,"source":"Scryfall Oracle/rulings subset for offline tests"}
